      "writtenOn": "2026-01-31T18:53:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This would make configuration for devices a lot easier. e.g. Instead of having to decommonize the whole manifest entry for health, it can be handled properly.\n\nThough honestly the architecture of the health hal just doesn\u0027t quite account for this scenario, which means resorting to something like this is the only way.",
