      "message": "The proper way is to have a target hal without charging control. It\u0027s not really difficult, rc+xml and .bp target that avoids starting the hal, it doesn\u0027t make it much harder.\n\nIf you don\u0027t support a feature you really shouldn\u0027t ship the hal",
